                                                "example_id": "b2dcae8b-9f76-4b99-a630-fe9af40a0f07",
                                                "sense_id": "72e1acea-615c-3740-8ef9-8c28c8910058",
                                                "text": "Although the PP won the most seats, it fell short of a parliamentary majority and has proved unable to form a government, even with the support of the far-right Vox party and other, smaller political groupings."
